  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ID YIFOS Liberty Inclusion &amp; Acceptance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Full Project Title: ALLIANCE - Advocating for Liberty, Inclusion, and Acceptance for all!

ALLIANCE: &quot;Advocating for Liberty, Inclusion, and Acceptance for all!&quot; is an advocacy step based on collaborative work between several organizations. ALLIANCE isled by YIFoS Indonesia, working with Yayasan Satu Keadilan, who has experience in policy advocacy in West Java. In addition, ALLIANCE works with the KAMI ADA coalition; a LGBTIQ-led organisation based in the Bogor area. ALLIANCE focuses on advocating theP4S Regional Regulation ratified in Bogor City in December 2021. This regulation provides a legal basis for criminalizing LGBTIQ+ people. The idea is to encourage the Bogor City government to change the content of the regulations through the Mayor&apos;s initiative to submit a discussion (Nota Dinas) to the Bogor City DPR-D. The following is the theory of change from the ALLIANCE project: If civil society organizations, together with experts on human rights, law, and sexuality issues, can lobby the Mayor of Bogor and various civil society voices tourge the government to change the contents of the P4S regulation, the Mayor of Bogor will be encouraged to submit a discussion to the DPR -D at trial. ALLIANCE will then use this process to provide input at public hearings. To achieve the above changes, namely the change in the P4S script, several key activities must be carried out:

1. Drafting an alternative or substitute local regulation.
2. Hearings and lobbying key actors.
3. Public campaigning.
4. Capacitybuilding for the LGBTIQ community.

In preparing for this, ALLIANCE has also prepared a mitigation plan and a referral mechanism for the safety of the LGBTIQ community in Bogor.</narrative>
  </description>
